@startuml
' AD-029; source ../use-cases/UC-029-search-internal-garment-catalog.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-CAT-001; BR-029; CAP-14; PBI-046; US-CAT-001 AC.
' SRS: FR-CAT-001, FR-CAT-002, FR-CAT-003, FR-CAT-004; DATA-CAT-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-CAT-001; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q07, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-029 - Search the internal garment catalog
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-029;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|User|
:Enter supported internal-catalog search;
|CapsuleAI|
:Retrieve identifiable catalog results;
if (Retrieval available?) then (Yes)
  if (Matches available?) then (Yes)
    :Show descriptive results with qualified missing values;
  else (No matches)
    :Offer search change / reset;
    stop
  endif
else (Unavailable)
  :Explain unavailable catalog; offer retry / return;
  stop
endif
|User|
:Inspect result;
if (Explicit Add-to-Closet intent?) then (Yes)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Hand selected catalog item to UC-030 review;
else (Continue)
  :Continue discovery without owned addition;
endif
note right
  Catalog search differs from owned search (UC-008).
  Viewing / selecting does not confirm ownership.
end note

stop
@enduml
